    "description": {
      "en": "This is the employer old-age (pension) insurance contribution rate of 8.55%, applied to Income Group A (income up to the social security ceiling, PSS). It is used in tscer_fr's BenCalc function (Comp_perTU parameter, 'Old-age insurance contributions-main') as the main employer pension contribution rate, complemented by a smaller whole-income-based rate ($tscerpi_rate2); both are eligible for the general reduction on employer contributions for low earners."
